  "description": "The id-010 descriptor with the `p256.` tag stripped from `proof`. RFC-AITP-0002 §3.1 requires a `p256` sender to emit the tagged form, and RFC-AITP-0001 §5.4.3 reads an untagged signature as `ed25519`, so the tag does not match the sender AID's algorithm. The P-256 key is in `trust_store` and the raw 64 bytes are a valid P-256 signature over this `proof_input`, so the algorithm mismatch is the only reason to fail. Receiver MUST reject with IDENTITY_FAILED.",
  "tags": [
    "security",
    "identity",
    "pinned_key",
    "p256",
    "algorithm-tag"
  ],
