    "error_code": "IDENTITY_FAILED",
    "rationale": "Steps 1–3 of RFC-AITP-0002 §3.2 pass. At step 5 the untagged proof is read as `ed25519` (RFC-AITP-0001 §5.4.3), which does not match the `p256` sender AID (§5.4.3 rule 3). A verifier that infers the algorithm from the key, or tries P-256 on an untagged value, would accept it; that is the defect this fixture catches."
